   "review": "5.2 has some kind of fatal issue where you cannot open 2 blend files at once. all prior versions of the program allowed you to do this and now it's entirely broken. i typically use the steam version for ease of use but if this isn't fixed i will have to use the official site version. I have used blender for 10 years and honestly i can say it has been getting great features while the spec demands keep getting higher and higher. things that used to just work don't anymore and crashes are way more common than they used to be. i find that rendering often causes a crash and i have to trouble shoot for the next 20 minutes to figure out way. despite the new features and improvements to cycles, i feel like EEVEE has been left out to die. no support for the bevel shader node. EEVEE volumetrics for like 1 version worked then never again.",
